codemap 8
path feature-note-edit
kind flow
author ai
group features/cli
note note-edit <name> <index> <old> <new>: replace the first occurrence of old with new in one note, without resending the whole note. index -1 edits the path note, any other index the note of that step. It exists so a session fixing one clause after a code change does not have to retype a long note and risk dropping the rest of it. The command prints the whole note after the edit so the result can be reread.

